  "note": "First source found that publishes the NEW-number ranges per release for the whole JP tabletop line, 巻ノ一 (2002-12) to 巻ノ十七 (2006-09-08), plus the jumbo sheets, starter boxes and promo sheets that carry their own numbers. No card images at all — this is catalogue structure, not a face source. The union of the ranges below is the numbered JA universe: 忍 1-417, 術 1-361, 作 1-337, 依 1-46, 騎 1-8. Measured against our index on 2026-08-19: 119 numbered cards absent (忍 60, 術 26, 作 21, 依 4, 騎 8) and 349 held without a face. The 騎 family exists nowhere in our disk layout yet — it was minted by 拡張ファイリングシート (騎-1〜6, 2005-08) and 巻ノ十三 (騎-7〜8). Card size given as 86×59 mm. Brand was カードダス EX until mid-2005, then Carddass.",
